From e3b0c77818adc1006a3cc773ceebca665aa95194 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: syafiqnizam25 <muhammadsyafiqnizamuddinx.binshafie@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:08:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/17] media: ipu: align drivers with Q3.1 baseline

- align ipu7 with ipu7-drivers 484d713
- align with scaling repo release/26Q3.1 (ebc6e0f)

Signed-off-by: syafiqnizam25 <muhammadsyafiqnizamuddinx.binshafie@intel.com>
